{"root":{"data":{"id":"dldte2wisxk0","created":1789264672233,"text":"血液的一般检查"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtf2310f40","created":1789264748813,"text":"血常规检测概况"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtkzw0nzc0","created":1789265214221,"text":"血常规检测标本"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtl4atytc0","created":1789265223824,"text":"采血方法：静脉采血法，毛细血管采血\n采样体积：2ml/≥200ul\n紫管抗凝：常用EDTA K2（终浓度为1.5~2.2mg/ml），一般不用枸橼酸钠或肝素\n样本保存：室温下18℃~25℃，2~3h（不超过24h）\n "},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtlvkn4n40","created":1789265283190,"text":"RBC的检测"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtm23u3ow0","created":1789265297411,"text":"量的检测"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtmbiecxk0","created":1789265317883,"text":"个数——红细胞数量RBC：测定单位体积血液中红细胞的数量（10^{12}/L）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnd8v7ns0","created":1789265400024,"text":"方法：：自动血细胞计数仪、显微镜计数法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnho9otk0","created":1789265409663,"text":"参考值"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtnl47gt40","created":1789265417157,"text":"成年女性：3.5~5.0x10^{12}/L"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnot1p480","created":1789265425189,"text":"成年男性：4~5.5x10^{12}/L"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnru7jj40","created":1789265431790,"text":"新生儿：6.0~7.0x10^{12}/L"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}